 "answer_verbatim": "For a straightforward oil change, **SpeeDee Oil Change & Auto Service** is a good place to start: **44 Mission Dr, Pleasanton**. It specializes in oil changes and says the service typically takes 15–30 minutes once your car is in the bay. Its Yelp rating is mixed, though, so I’d check recent reviews and call ahead to confirm the price and wait time.\n\nIf you’d rather use a general repair shop with stronger review signals, **Superior Autowerks** (176 Wyoming St, Suite B) has positive customer comments about fair pricing and routine maintenance; call ahead, since parking is limited and appointments are recommended.\n\nBefore you go, confirm they have the right oil and filter for your vehicle and ask for the out-the-door price.",
